  "title": "Better Than Fruitcake Cookies",
  "description": "This recipe makes over 12 dozen small cookies... a great substitution for holiday fruitcake . You can substitute rum-soaked dried apricots and dates instead of glacee&#39;d cherries and figs for an equally tasty cookie.",
